  18:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****   @verbatim
  19:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****   How To use this driver:
  20:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****   --------------------------
  21:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****    - This driver is used to drive directly a LCD TFT using the LTDC controller.
  22:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****    - This driver uses the adequate timing and setting for the RK050HR18 LCD component
  23:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c **** 
  24:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****   Driver description:
  25:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****   ---------------------
  26:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****    + Initialization steps:
  27:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Initialize the LCD in default mode using the BSP_LCD_Init() function with the
  28:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        following settings:
  29:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****         - Pixelformat : LCD_PIXEL_FORMAT_RGB888
  30:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****         - Orientation : LCD_ORIENTATION_LANDSCAPE.
  31:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****         - Width       : LCD_DEFAULT_WIDTH (800)
  32:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****         - Height      : LCD_DEFAULT_HEIGHT(480)
  33:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        The default LTDC layer configured is layer 0.
  34:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        BSP_LCD_Init() includes LTDC, LTDC Layer and clock configurations by calling:
  35:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****         - MX_LTDC_ClockConfig()
  36:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****         - MX_LTDC_Init()
  37:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****         - MX_LTDC_ConfigLayer()
  38:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c **** 
  39:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Initialize the LCD with required parameters using the BSP_LCD_InitEx() function.
  40:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c **** 
  41:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Select the LCD layer to be used using the BSP_LCD_SelectLayer() function.
  42:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Enable the LCD display using the BSP_LCD_DisplayOn() function.
  43:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Disable the LCD display using the BSP_LCD_DisplayOff() function.
  44:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Write a pixel to the LCD memory using the BSP_LCD_WritePixel() function.
  45:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Read a pixel from the LCD memory using the BSP_LCD_ReadPixel() function.
  46:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Draw an horizontal line using the BSP_LCD_DrawHLine() function.
  47:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Draw a vertical line using the BSP_LCD_DrawVLine() function.
  48:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Draw a bitmap image using the BSP_LCD_DrawBitmap() function.
  49:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c **** 
  50:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****    + Options
  51:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Configure the LTDC reload mode by calling BSP_LCD_Reload(). By default, the
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccpqFtTj.s 			page 28


  52:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        reload mode is set to BSP_LCD_RELOAD_IMMEDIATE then LTDC is reloaded immediately.
  53:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        To control the reload mode:
  54:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****          - Call BSP_LCD_Reload() with ReloadType parameter set to BSP_LCD_RELOAD_NONE
  55:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****          - Configure LTDC (color keying, transparency ..)
  56:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****          - Call BSP_LCD_Reload() with ReloadType parameter set to BSP_LCD_RELOAD_IMMEDIATE
  57:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****            for immediate reload or BSP_LCD_RELOAD_VERTICAL_BLANKING for LTDC reload
  58:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****            in the next vertical blanking
  59:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Configure LTDC layers using BSP_LCD_ConfigLayer()
  60:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Control layer visibility using BSP_LCD_SetLayerVisible()
  61:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Configure and enable the color keying functionality using the
  62:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        BSP_LCD_SetColorKeying() function.
  63:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Disable the color keying functionality using the BSP_LCD_ResetColorKeying() function.
  64:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o Modify on the fly the transparency and/or the frame buffer address
  65:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        using the following functions:
  66:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        - BSP_LCD_SetTransparency()
  67:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        - BSP_LCD_SetLayerAddress()
  68:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c **** 
  69:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****    + Display on LCD
  70:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****      o To draw and fill a basic shapes (dot, line, rectangle, circle, ellipse, .. bitmap)
  71:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        on LCD and display text, utility basic_gui.c/.h must be called. Once the LCD is initialized,
  72:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        user should call GUI_SetFuncDriver() API to link board LCD drivers to BASIC GUI LCD drivers.
  73:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****        The basic gui services, defined in basic_gui utility, are ready for use.
  74:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c **** 
  75:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****   Note:
  76:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****   --------
  77:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****     Regarding the "Instance" parameter, needed for all functions, it is used to select
  78:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****     an LCD instance. On the STM32N6570 Discovery board, there's one instance. Then, this
  79:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****     parameter should be 0.
  80:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c **** 
  81:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/STM32N6570-DK/stm32n6570_discovery_lcd.c ****   @endverbatim
